      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #42073. Sending weights with an uninitialized group, or repeating a send after its group was consumed, raises `KeyError` before the existing failure response can run. This exception escapes the scheduler's control handler.\n\n## Modifications\n\nLook up the resolved rank-specific group with `dict.get`, allowing the existing failure message to reach the HTTP layer as a 400. Registered groups retain their existing broadcast and destruction behavior.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- Four permanent CPU tests pass; the original source fails two. Cover missing/other-rank and explicit `None` entries, successful send followed by repeated send, and broadcast-error cleanup.\n- An actual-source HTTP → tokenizer control → scheduler → TP worker → exporter probe returns 400/200/400 for missing/registered/consumed groups (original: 500/200/500). The IPC transport and GPU/distributed boundaries are doubled; this does not launch a scheduler process or execute NCCL. The local test harness excludes eager GPU package initialization.\n- All applicable pre-commit hooks pass.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable: this fixes control-request error handling.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the contribution guide.\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the contribution guide.\n- [ ] Update documentation according to the contribution guide. The existing initialization requirement is unchanged.\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results. No GPU execution was available locally.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\nAI-assisted implementation and tests, with independent source review.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36891770699](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36891770699)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36891770076](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36891770076)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36891770394](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36891770394)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
